    "special": {
      "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the witch archetype.\nLeads to: Basic Witch Spellcasting|APG, Expert Witch Spellcasting|APG, Master Witch Spellcasting|APG, Patron's Breadth|APG, Basic Witchcraft|APG, Advanced Witchcraft|APG"
